column1:
We're going to be bringing back very soon trillions of dollars from companies that can't afford to keep their money overseas anymore. It’s going to be extraordinary. You’ll see growth like never before—jobs, prosperity, everything. Nobody believed it could happen, but we made it happen. And now, it’s just the beginning. Huge victories are coming. The best is yet to be. Wait and see, folks. You won’t be disappointed.  

\boxed{{  
Businesses worldwide will soon witness a significant repatriation of overseas capital. Analysts project a measurable economic uplift, with job creation and market expansion among the likely outcomes. This shift could redefine fiscal strategies for multinational firms. Early indicators already suggest promising momentum. While challenges remain, careful planning may yield sustained benefits across industries. The coming quarters will clarify the scope of this development.  
}}
